    {
      "item_id": "meq_09",
      "text": "You have decided to do physical exercise. A friend suggests that you do this for one hour twice a week, and the best time for him is between 7-8 AM. Bearing in mind nothing but your own internal “clock,” how do you think you would perform?",
      "response_options_key": "meq_09",
